ises ~5% YoY to Rs 200.3 cr.","**Apeejay Surrendra Park Hotels** -- opens a 42-room Zone Connect by The Park hotel in Mathura, its first in the Brij Bhoomi pilgrimage circuit; no financial terms disclosed.","**Results season** — 129 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here."],"distress_risk":["**Reliance Communications** (under CIRP) -- DoT seeks partial encashment of Rs 26.63 lakh from Rs 5.37 cr of bank guarantees of RCL/subsidiary RTL over unpaid spectrum usage charges.","**Jindal Photo** -- completes its voluntary delisting from BSE and NSE; the Reverse Book Building process ran 2-6 Nov and the Post Offer PA was published 9-Nov."],"credit_rating_changes":["**Adani Power** -- ICRA upgrades the long-term rating to AA+ (Stable) from AA (Stable); short-term A1+ reaffirmed and assigned to enhanced facilities.","**Sahyadri Industries** -- ICRA upgrades its long-term bank facilities to A (Stable) from A- (Stable) and short-term to A1 from A2+, across Rs 270.30 cr of rated facilities."],"other_notable":["**Kesoram Industries** -- wins an arbitral award of Rs 59.89 cr (Rs 9.55 cr principal plus interest) receivable from Kesoram Textile Mills; recovery subject to enforcement.","**Jyothy Labs** -- raises its tender-offer buyback price Rs 215 -> Rs 240/share, cutting the shares to be bought back 68.37L -> 61.25L (same ~1.67% of paid-up capital).","**Pace Digitek** -- NSE and BSE grant in-principle approval to list up to 20,00,000 equity shares issuable under its 2026 Employee Stock Option Scheme.","**HCL Technologies** -- launches a semiconductor Product Lifecycle Management solution with PTC's Windchill platform; no financial terms disclosed.","⚑ **ARSS Infrastructure Projects Ltd** — Amendment to Memorandum of Association subject Shareholders approval (Rs 600.00 cr) _(⚑ filing content disagrees with the subject tag — held out of movers)_","**Pilani Invest